1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,552
Sita said that she was busy that day.

2
00:00:02,552 --> 00:00:11,705
Count the changes: a link word, that; the pronoun, I to she; the tense, am to was; and the time word, today to that day.

3
00:00:11,705 --> 00:00:17,773
Do them in the same order every time, and reported speech becomes almost automatic.

